{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1305909-2e-problematic-gift-s-facets","id":1305909,"title":"[2E] Problematic Gift's Facets","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-18T22:32:15-07:00","id":1305909,"title":"[2E] Problematic Gift's Facets","content":"Topic for finding problems with usage of Facets - or problematic Facets to use. Here is one example my players stumble upon...<br /> <br /> <i>Skin Thief</i> (Cunning) from Gift of Change says:<br /> <br /> 'Although grisly, an Uratha with this Facet can don the skin of a kill as if it were his own natural hide.<br /> (...)<br /> The Uratha can only use this Facet while in Hishu form. He must skin a human or predatory animal of roughly the same size as a wolf, enough to wear across his shoulders at least, and then don the skin.'<br /> <br /> <b>So, character need<i> the skin</i> of person, not to kill the person per se? </b>So, theoretically, if character flayer the enemy of skin and sustain him alive, somehow, he can <i>no</i>t kill enemy by it?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flaying#Causes_of_death\" target=\"_blank\">Seeing Wikipedia article on Flaying, I see it's in real life <i>impossible</i> to not kill target of it</a> - but with spirits magic it is possible, right? You flay the victim, heal him before his death in few hours, and let him live?<br /> <br /> Side question - <i>Skin Thief</i> wording is a bit unclear. <b>If I use human skin for the Facet I can shapeshift only once to target - or do my Hishu form is changed into appearance of the skin's original for the whole lunar month?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-19-2019, 01:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-18T23:13:33-07:00","id":1305913,"title":"","content":"You're a monster with a built-in sense of normalcy for murder. What's the issue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-19T01:12:37-07:00","id":1305928,"title":"","content":"I think it\u2019s pretty clear. You skin the target, you wear their skin. Whether they survive is irrelevant to the Gift. (Most will die. You really can\u2019t live without skin.)<br /> <br /> To answer your second question, as long as you stay in Hishu you retain the form. How long you manage to do so is up to you, though I\u2019d suggest it would be fair for STs to call a Breaking Point towards Flesh if you don\u2019t shapeshifter for a month or more. If you shapeshifter at all you lose the appearance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-19T02:00:23-07:00","id":1305934,"title":"","content":"Thank you, <b>Bunyip</b>, for clearing whole thing! Return to topic if I have other problematic Facets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-19T09:31:49-07:00","id":1306019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1305909-2e-problematic-gift-s-facets#post1305909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see it's in real life <i>impossible</i> to not kill target of it[/URL] - but with spirits magic it is possible, right? You flay the victim, heal him before his death in few hours, and let him live?</div> </div> </div> </div>If you're doing it to a person, people lose limbs all the time and manage to survive. And an arm or leg will generally have enough skin to wear across one's shoulders.<br /> <br /> And if you're a particularly ghoulish werewolf, nothing requires a live victim to begin with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-19-2019, 12:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-19T11:57:58-07:00","id":1326056,"title":"","content":"If you skin a victim with the intent of leaving them alive, I'm gonna make you Breaking Point the shit out of it for not Respecting Your Prey enough to end it's suffering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}